{"step_index":2739,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T12:52:03Z","thinking":"The task requires a function to format confidence values into human-readable strings. The function should handle cases for exact matches, LLM matches, and \"high\" confidence levels with numeric values. It is important to handle empty or missing confidence values.\n\n\nConstructing the summary sheet, including header definitions and data population. Formulas are being defined to calculate the total requested items.  Formulas are built to sum matched items from the warehouse results dynamically based on the number of results.  The \"not found\" items are also calculated along with the need for review.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"view_file","args":{"AbsolutePath":"d:/AI_Engineer/Pharmacy-agy/src/output/excel_writer.py","ContentOffset":0,"EndLine":85,"StartLine":30,"toolAction":"Viewing helper functions in excel_writer.py","toolSummary":"View styles and helpers in excel_writer.py"}}]}
{"step_index":2740,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T12:52:09Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-22T15:52:09+03:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-22T15:52:09+03:00\nFile Path: `file:///d:/AI_Engineer/Pharmacy-agy/src/output/excel_writer.py`\nTotal Lines: 248\nTotal Bytes: 10540\nShowing lines 30 to 85\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n30: \n31: def _apply_header_style(ws, num_cols: int) -> None:\n32:     \"\"\"تطبيق تنسيق الرأس على الصف الأول.\"\"\"\n33:     for col_idx in range(1, num_cols + 1):\n34:         cell = ws.cell(row=1, column=col_idx)\n35:         cell.fill = _HEADER_FILL\n36:         cell.font = _HEADER_FONT\n37:         cell.alignment = _HEADER_ALIGNMENT\n38:         cell.border = _THIN_BORDER\n39: \n40: \n41: def _format_sheet(ws, num_cols: int) -> None:\n42:     \"\"\"تنسيق الورقة: تجميد الصف الأول، فلتر تلقائي، RTL، عرض الأعمدة.\"\"\"\n43:     # تجميد الصف الأول\n44:     ws.freeze_panes = \"A2\"\n45: \n46:     # فلتر تلقائي\n47:     if ws.max_row > 0 and num_cols > 0:\n48:         last_col_letter = get_column_letter(num_cols)\n49:         ws.auto_filter.ref = f\"A1:{last_col_letter}{ws.max_row}\"\n50: \n51:     # اتجاه الورقة من اليمين لليسار\n52:     ws.sheet_view.rightToLeft = True\n53: \n54:     # عرض الأعمدة التلقائي (تقدير بسيط)\n55:     for col_idx in range(1, num_cols + 1):\n56:         max_length = 0\n57:         col_letter = get_column_letter(col_idx)\n58:         for row in ws.iter_rows(\n59:             min_col=col_idx, max_col=col_idx, min_row=1, max_row=ws.max_row\n60:         ):\n61:             for cell in row:\n62:                 if cell.value:\n63:                     # حساب العرض التقريبي (الحروف العربية أعرض)\n64:                     cell_len = len(str(cell.value))\n65:                     max_length = max(max_length, cell_len)\n66:         # حد أدنى 12، حد أقصى 60\n67:         adjusted_width = min(max(max_length + 4, 12), 60)\n68:         ws.column_dimensions[col_letter].width = adjusted_width\n69: \n70: \n71: def _add_data_rows(ws, rows: list[list], start_row: int = 2) -> None:\n72:     \"\"\"إضافة صفوف البيانات مع التنسيق.\"\"\"\n73:     for row_idx, row_data in enumerate(rows, start=start_row):\n74:         for col_idx, value in enumerate(row_data, start=1):\n75:             cell = ws.cell(row=row_idx, column=col_idx, value=value)\n76:             cell.font = _CELL_FONT\n77:             cell.alignment = _CELL_ALIGNMENT\n78:             cell.border = _THIN_BORDER\n79: \n80: \n81: def _truncate_sheet_name(name: str, max_len: int = 31) -> str:\n82:     \"\"\"\n83:     اقتطاع اسم الورقة ليتوافق مع حد Excel (31 حرفاً).\n84:     يزيل أيضاً الأحرف غير المسموح بها في أسماء الأوراق.\n85:     \"\"\"\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
{"step_index":2741,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T12:52:09Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Add dynamic Excel formulas to summary sheet and Arabic confidence formatting","EndLine":185,"Instruction":"Add _format_confidence and update ws_summary generation with formulas and confidence formatting","ReplacementContent":"def _format_confidence(conf_raw: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"تحويل قيم درجة التطابق الإنجليزية والتقنية إلى مصطلحات عربية واضحة.\"\"\"\n    if not conf_raw:\n        return \"\"\n    conf_str = str(conf_raw).strip()\n    conf_lower = conf_str.lower()\n    if conf_lower == \"exact\":\n        return \"تطابق تام (100%)\"\n    elif conf_lower == \"llm\":\n        return \"مطابقة ذكية (AI)\"\n    elif conf_lower.startswith(\"high\"):\n        m = re.search(r\"([\\d\\.]+)\", conf_str)\n        if m:\n            pct = int(float(m.group(1)) * 100)\n            return f\"تطابق نصي دقيق ({pct}%)\"\n        return \"تطابق نصي دقيق\"\n    elif conf_str == \"تأكيد يدوي (مراجعة)\":\n        return conf_str\n    return conf_str\n\n\ndef create_excel_report(results: dict, output_path: Path) -> Path:\n    \"\"\"\n    إنشاء ملف Excel منظم يحتوي على:\n        - ملخص ديناميكي مربوط بمعادلات Excel التلقائية\n        - ورقة لكل مخزن تحتوي على المطابقات المؤكدة\n        - ورقة للأصناف التي تحتاج مراجعة\n        - ورقة للأصناف التي لم يُعثر عليها\n\n    المعاملات:\n        results: قاموس يحتوي على:\n            - warehouse_results: نتائج كل مخزن\n            - not_found: الأصناف غير الموجودة\n            - summary: ملخص إحصائي\n        output_path: مسار ملف Excel الناتج.\n    \"\"\"\n    wb = Workbook()\n\n    # ────────────────────────────────────────\n    # ورقة الملخص (ديناميكية مربوطة بالمعادلات)\n    # ────────────────────────────────────────\n    ws_summary = wb.active\n    ws_summary.title = \"ملخص\"\n\n    summary = results.get(\"summary\", {})\n    warehouse_results = results.get(\"warehouse_results\", {})\n\n    summary_headers = [\"البند\", \"العدد\", \"النسبة\"]\n    ws_summary.append(summary_headers)\n    _apply_header_style(ws_summary, len(summary_headers))\n\n    # Row 2: إجمالي الأصناف المطلوبة = المطابقة + غير الموجود + المراجعة\n    ws_summary.append([\"إجمالي الأصناف المطلوبة\", \"=B3+B4+B5\", \"100%\"])\n\n    # Row 3: تم مطابقتها (مجموع مطابقة المخازن من جدول التفاصيل بالأسفل)\n    num_wh = len(warehouse_results)\n    wh_sum_formula = f\"=SUM(B8:B{7 + num_wh})\" if num_wh > 0 else \"0\"\n    ws_summary.append([\"تم مطابقتها\", wh_sum_formula, \"=IF(B2>0, B3/B2, 0)\"])\n\n    # Row 4: لم يُعثر عليها\n    ws_summary.append([\"لم يُعثر عليها\", \"=MAX(0, COUNTA('لم يُعثر عليه'!A:A)-1)\", \"=IF(B2>0, B4/B2, 0)\"])\n\n    # Row 5: تحتاج مراجعة\n    ws_summary.append([\"تحتاج مراجعة\", \"=MAX(0, COUNTA('يحتاج مراجعة'!A:A)-1)\", \"=IF(B2>0, B5/B2, 0)\"])\n\n    # Row 6: صف فارغ\n    ws_summary.append([])\n\n    # Row 7: جدول تفاصيل كل مخزن\n    ws_summary.append([\"─── تفاصيل المخازن ───\", \"عدد المطابقات\", \"أصناف للمراجعة\"])\n    for c_idx in range(1, 4):\n        c = ws_summary.cell(row=7, column=c_idx)\n        c.fill = _HEADER_FILL\n        c.font = _HEADER_FONT\n        c.alignment = _HEADER_ALIGNMENT\n        c.border = _THIN_BORDER\n\n    # صفوف المخازن (Rows 8+)\n    detail_row = 8\n    for wh_name in warehouse_results.keys():\n        sheet_name = _truncate_sheet_name(wh_name)\n        matched_formula = f\"=MAX(0, COUNTA('{sheet_name}'!A:A)-1)\"\n        review_formula = f'=COUNTIF(\\'يحتاج مراجعة\\'!D:D, \"{wh_name}\")'\n        ws_summary.append([wh_name, matched_formula, review_formula])\n        detail_row += 1\n\n    # تطبيق التنسيق والخطوط على كل خلايا الملخص\n    for r in range(2, detail_row):\n        if r == 6 or r == 7:\n            continue\n        for c in range(1, 4):\n            cell = ws_summary.cell(row=r, column=c)\n            cell.font = _CELL_FONT\n            cell.alignment = _CELL_ALIGNMENT\n            cell.border = _THIN_BORDER\n\n    # تنسيق النسب المئوية كـ %\n    ws_summary.cell(row=2, column=3).alignment = _CELL_ALIGNMENT\n    ws_summary.cell(row=3, column=3).number_format = \"0.0%\"\n    ws_summary.cell(row=4, column=3).number_format = \"0.0%\"\n    ws_summary.cell(row=5, column=3).number_format = \"0.0%\"\n\n    _format_sheet(ws_summary, len(summary_headers))\n\n    # ────────────────────────────────────────\n    # ورقة لكل مخزن (المطابقات المؤكدة فقط)\n    # ────────────────────────────────────────\n    for wh_name, wh_data in warehouse_results.items():\n        sheet_name = _truncate_sheet_name(wh_name)\n        ws_wh = wb.create_sheet(title=sheet_name)\n\n        headers = [\"اسم الصنف المطلوب\", \"اسم الصنف في المخزن\", \"درجة التطابق\"]\n        ws_wh.append(headers)\n        _apply_header_style(ws_wh, len(headers))\n\n        matched_items = wh_data.get(\"matched\", [])\n        rows = []\n        for match in matched_items:\n            shortage_name = match.get(\"shortage_item\", \"\")\n            warehouse_item = match.get(\"warehouse_item\", \"\")\n            confidence = _format_confidence(match.get(\"confidence\", \"\"))\n            rows.append([shortage_name, warehouse_item, confidence])","StartLine":100,"TargetContent":"            - not_found: الأصناف غير الموجودة\n            - summary: ملخص إحصائي\n        output_path: مسار ملف Excel الناتج.\n    \"\"\"\n    wb = Workbook()\n\n    # ────────────────────────────────────────\n    # ورقة الملخص\n    # ────────────────────────────────────────\n    ws_summary = wb.active\n    ws_summary.title = \"ملخص\"\n\n    summary = results.get(\"summary\", {})\n    warehouse_results = results.get(\"warehouse_results\", {})\n\n    summary_headers = [\"البند\", \"العدد\", \"النسبة\"]\n    ws_summary.append(summary_headers)\n    _apply_header_style(ws_summary, len(summary_headers))\n\n    total = summary.get(\"total_shortages\", 0)\n    matched = summary.get(\"matched_count\", 0)\n    not_found = summary.get(\"not_found_count\", 0)\n    review = summary.get(\"review_count\", 0)\n\n    summary_data = [\n        [\"إجمالي الأصناف المطلوبة\", total, \"\"],\n        [\n            \"تم مطابقتها\",\n            matched,\n            f\"{matched / total * 100:.1f}%\" if total > 0 else \"0%\",\n        ],\n        [\n            \"لم يُعثر عليها\",\n            not_found,\n            f\"{not_found / total * 100:.1f}%\" if total > 0 else \"0%\",\n        ],\n        [\n            \"تحتاج مراجعة\",\n            review,\n            f\"{review / total * 100:.1f}%\" if total > 0 else \"0%\",\n        ],\n        [],  # صف فارغ\n        [\"─── تفاصيل المخازن ───\", \"\", \"\"],\n    ]\n    _add_data_rows(ws_summary, summary_data)\n\n    # تفاصيل كل مخزن\n    detail_row = len(summary_data) + 3\n    for wh_name, wh_data in warehouse_results.items():\n        wh_matched = len(wh_data.get(\"matched\", []))\n        wh_review = len(wh_data.get(\"needs_review\", []))\n        ws_summary.cell(row=detail_row, column=1, value=wh_name).font = _CELL_FONT\n        ws_summary.cell(\n            row=detail_row, column=2, value=f\"مطابق: {wh_matched}\"\n        ).font = _CELL_FONT\n        ws_summary.cell(\n            row=detail_row, column=3, value=f\"مراجعة: {wh_review}\"\n        ).font = _CELL_FONT\n        detail_row += 1\n\n    _format_sheet(ws_summary, len(summary_headers))\n\n    # ────────────────────────────────────────\n    # ورقة لكل مخزن (المطابقات المؤكدة فقط)\n    # ────────────────────────────────────────\n    for wh_name, wh_data in warehouse_results.items():\n        sheet_name = _truncate_sheet_name(wh_name)\n        ws_wh = wb.create_sheet(title=sheet_name)\n\n        headers = [\"اسم الصنف المطلوب\", \"اسم الصنف في المخزن\", \"درجة التطابق\"]\n        ws_wh.append(headers)\n        _apply_header_style(ws_wh, len(headers))\n\n        matched_items = wh_data.get(\"matched\", [])\n        rows = []\n        for match in matched_items:\n            sh